a, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\det(A)&=\\begin{vmatrix}1+t & 2t \\\\ -3 & 1-t\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&=(1+t)(1-t)-(2t)(-3) \\\\\n&=1-t^2+6t.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\det(A)=10$, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n1-t^2+6t&=10 \\\\\nt^2-6t+9&=0 \\\\\n(t-3)^2&=0 \\\\\nt&=3.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139541441 17592186576411 true] [17592186233379 1068 #edb/ref 17592186716953 13194139541441 17592186576411 true] [17592186233379 1071 "If\n$$\n\\displaystyle D=\\begin{bmatrix}2x & 6 \\\\ 2x & x-2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand $det(D)=-32$, what is the value of $x?$" 13194139541441 17592186576411 false] [17592186233379 1071 "If\n$$\n\\displaystyle D=\\begin{bmatrix}2x & 6 \\\\ 2x & x-2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand $det(D)=-32$, what is the value of $x?$\n\n$x=$ {{field-1}}" 13194139541441 17592186576411 true] [17592186716952 1080 "4" 13194139541441 17592186576411 true] [17592186716952 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139541441 17592186576411 true] [17592186716952 1083 #uuid "2d273204-9c71-5dd0-b69b-1a90276ae151" 13194139541441 17592186576411 true] [17592186716953 1075 #edb/ref 17592186716952 13194139541441 17592186576411 true] [17592186716953 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139541441 17592186576411 true] [17592186716953 1077 "field-1" 13194139541441 17592186576411 true] [17592186716953 1078 #edb/ref 17592186716952 13194139541441 17592186576411 true] [17592186716953 1079 #uuid "d37edfe3-8d04-5659-9550-117d4c4acd83" 13194139541441 17592186576411 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer" 17592186716952 "field" 17592186716953}}
